---
import ContactLinks from './ContactLinks.astro';
import HeroBackdrop from './HeroBackdrop.astro';
import Portrait from './Portrait.astro';

const rotatorLines = [
  "We have AI access now, but the tools aren't making us faster",
  "We're drowning in output, but verification is choking us now",
  "We track AI spend perfectly, but the bottom line moves in the wrong direction!",
  "We're a <s>hardware</s> business, AI can't help us here",
  "We're a <s>people</s> business, AI can't help us here",
  "We're an <s>infrastructure</s> business, AI can't help us here",
  "We're an <s>R&amp;D lab</s> here, AI like this can't help us"
];
---
<section class="hero-section" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-backdrop-shell">
    <HeroBackdrop />
  </div>
  <div class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Enterprise AI, data, and workflow delivery</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">
        <span class="hero-rotator" data-lines={JSON.stringify(rotatorLines)}>
          <span class="hero-rotator-line" set:html={rotatorLines[0]} />
        </span>
      </h1>
      <div class="hero-copy-flow">
        <p class="hero-subline">AI is an amplifier of your processes: better process leads to much better and faster AI ROI.</p>
        <div class="hero-support">
          <p>But you don't have the time to figure out where the <em>current</em> capabilities can achieve the highest benefit:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>across departments</li>
            <li>across jurisdictions</li>
          </ul>
          <p>And you lack the people to implement what's already on the roadmap.</p>
          <p class="hero-closing">If you are drowning in an ocean of opportunity, a hero is what you need.</p>
        </div>
        <ContactLinks />
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-rail" aria-label="Credibility rail">
      <div class="hero-proof">
        <p class="hero-proof-label">Selected proof</p>
        <h2>Built in live robotics deployments, research-heavy evidence pipelines, and enterprise AI delivery.</h2>
        <ul class="hero-proof-list">
          <li>Amazon Robotics deployment work in operating environments</li>
          <li>DLR evidence pipelines for experimental systems</li>
          <li>Enterprise AI delivery for financial and industrial clients</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <Portrait />
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/hero-rotator';
</script>
